01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
Henry & June is a 1990 American biographical drama film directed by Philip
Kaufman, and starring Fred Ward, Uma Thurman, and Maria de Medeiros.

13
01:38:13,333 --> 01:38:19,333
It is loosely based on the posthumously published 1986 Anaïs Nin book of the same name, and
tells the story of Nin's relationship with Henry Miller and his wife, June.

14
01:45:46,666 --> 01:45:52,666
The film was nominated for Best Cinematography at the 63rd Academy Awards.

15
01:53:20,000 --> 01:53:26,000
